{title: How Great Thou Art}
{key: Bb}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Bb]O Lord my [Eb]God, when I in [Bb]awesome wonder
Con[F]sider all the [F7]worlds Thy hands have [Bb]made
[Bb]I see the [Eb]stars, I hear the [Bb]rolling thunder
Thy [F]power throughout the [F7]uni-verse dis[Bb]played
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Then sings my [Eb]soul, my Savior God, to [Bb]Thee
How great Thou [F]art, how great Thou [Bb]art
Then sings my [Eb]soul, my Savior God, to [Bb]Thee
How great Thou [F]art, how [F7]great Thou [Bb]art
{end_of_chorus}
